# UX workflow: visual semantics overview for the 8-step sequencer page.
# Purpose: captures representative tile states on one page: plain note,
# probability, micro-sequence, cycle-state, nested content, and playback.
# Expect: playhead_progress

0 scenario seq-semantic-grid
80 capture screen semantic_grid_ready

# Start playback so the same semantic markers can be checked with playhead state.
180 tap BOTTOM_CENTER 60
520 capture screen semantic_grid_playing_early
900 tick
980 capture screen semantic_grid_playing_late
1080 tap BOTTOM_CENTER 60
1300 capture screen semantic_grid_stopped
